{
  "name": "Fighting lung disease in textile mills ",
  "parent_id": 203313630673674,
  "group_id": "9b30e619-e1b3-444e-871a-1be34497685a",
  "alternates": [],
  "created_at": "2026-07-30T15:23:57.622Z",
  "deleted_at": null,
  "sort_by_date": null,
  "tag_list": [],
  "updated_at": "2026-07-30T15:23:57.703Z",
  "published_at": "2026-07-30T15:23:57.690Z",
  "id": 203716352548861,
  "uuid": "ef061255-654c-46d4-9fb7-9352e0a8fa6d",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "d596e39b-6f2c-aad7-681f-748ae5933619",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "9985ac45-2252-d328-8ce9-916f5d4e2b77",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Assistant Professor Asaad Nafees and his team are working with six textile mills that employ approximately 9,000 people to reduce lung problems by training management and workers on limiting exposure to cotton dust, including through the use of face masks, improved ventilation and safe disposal of waste.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Before-and-after measurements of air quality and workers' lung function, as well as improvements in their knowledge and practices, will make clear the extent of the project's impact. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "But Khairoonnissa Merchant, Head of Human Resources and Compliance at International Textile Ltd., said the company is already losing fewer days to illness and injury as a result of AKU's training sessions. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"When the Aga Khan team talks to the workers, it is like they are talking to a friend, and the workers really listen to them,\" she said, echoing sentiments expressed by other managers participating in the study. \"We are looking forward to continuing this relationship.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Though the study - called MultiTex for short - is ongoing, government and industry are already interested in expanding it. \"Nothing like MultiTex has been done in Pakistan,\" said Dr Hasan Nawaz Tahir, who is working on the study with Dr Nafees. \"It's a win-win situation for everyone.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
